{"slug":"/components/terminal-login","title":"Terminal Login — Animated React Component — Planes","desc":"A getty login on an amber CRT.","html":"<main class=\"min-w-0 py-24\"><section><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center justify-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1.5 px-4 pb-2 sm:px-8 lg:px-16\"><h1 class=\"text-2xl font-semibold tracking-[-0.03em] sm:text-3xl\">Terminal Login</h1><span class=\"inline-flex items-center gap-1 rounded-full bg-foreground/8 px-2 py-0.5 text-[11px] font-semibold text-foreground\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-lock size-3\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"18\" height=\"11\" x=\"3\" y=\"11\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4\"></path></svg> Pro</span></div><div class=\"py-10 sm:py-14\"><div class=\"relative flex items-center justify-center bg-background min-h-[60vh] py-12 sm:py-16\"><div class=\"flex w-full flex-col items-center gap-4 px-4 py-12\"><div class=\"relative w-full max-w-[720px] overflow-hidden rounded-[22px] bg-[#141414] p-3 shadow-[0_30px_80px_-40px_rgba(0,0,0,0.8)] ring-1 ring-white/[0.06] sm:p-4\"><style>@keyframes planes-tty-blink{0%,49%{opacity:1}50%,100%{opacity:0}}</style><div class=\"relative aspect-[4/3] overflow-hidden rounded-[14px] bg-[#0a0906]\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 origin-center\" style=\"will-change:transform, filter;filter:brightness(4);transform:scaleY(0.004)\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 px-[6%] py-[5%] font-mono text-[13px] leading-[1.55] sm:text-[15px]\" style=\"color:#ffb000;text-shadow:0 0 6px #ffb00066, 0 0 1px #ffb000\"><div class=\"min-h-[1.55em] whitespace-pre-wrap break-all\">planes 1.0 tty1</div><div class=\"min-h-[1.55em] whitespace-pre-wrap break-all\"></div><div class=\"relative flex min-h-[1.55em] items-start whitespace-pre-wrap break-all\"><label for=\"_R_1kqnpfksnksdb_\" class